    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR5c0126-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:21:51.088+09:00">通达性命实情的人,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:03.062+09:00">不去追求性命所不能做到的东西;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:43.808+09:00">通达命运实情的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:57.594+09:00">养育形体必先有财物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:54.854+09:00">不去追求命运所无可奈何的东西。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:05.3+09:00">财物充余而形体养不好的大有人在;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:14.309+09:00">存活必定先不能离开形体,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:23.006+09:00">形体不死而生命死去的大有人在。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:28.961+09:00">生命的到来不能推却，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:33.051+09:00">生命离去不能留住。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:41.854+09:00">可悲啊！</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:47.898+09:00">世俗的人以为养育形体就足以保存生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:24:10.125+09:00">而养育形体果真不足以保存生命，那么，世事还有什么值得做呢？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:08.119+09:00">虽然不值得做</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:13.117+09:00">却又不能不做，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:15.157+09:00">就是不能免除。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
